I spoke to Matt to see if he had seen this before and he has no clue as to why these should just appear.  I believe this could be down to Ethan unticking and ticking the box but did not pop on patient until i went back into patient details.  There is no other explanation.  Trust are going to have to monitor and let us know if this happens again.  Both of the above patinets data now showing

