Morning All,

Rebecca is working on getting you guys screenshots but in the meantime I just describe what I’ve seen.

 

It seems that when users try to open symphony, its as if symphony is trying to install or uninstall something. You get a progress bar which obviously goes from left to right, but it seems to get to the end and just disappears before it starts all over again.

 

I though the fix was simple in that I would log in with my admin account and just let symphony do whatever install/uninstall thing it wanted. This appeared to fix the issue, but I have started to receive calls now from people I has done this for to say it’s happening again.

 

I’d say to date, I’ve come across this on around 6 or 7 devices. Tracey in cardiology is currently experiencing the issue for the second time so I have asked Rebecca is she could get a screen shot from that PC.

 

Regards,
Jason

