04/02/2026 11:05:23 - Rachel Wilson (Work notes)
Notes from Delivery team 
Our Symphony customer at BSUH have identified an issue with retrospective flagging.
This has been noticed with a NEWS score column but its found on all flags.
If a DEP contains a field which is set to flag
When that DEP is entered multiple times, if the DEP is backdated to appear earlier in the e-view, the flag data for ""Most Recently Recorded"" is taken from that DEP, even though chronologically in the e-view it is not the most recent.
This is in v3.1.1.14
It appears this is an issue with how data is stored in the dbo.Cat_Details table holding the res_created date instead of the res_date/time
""it holds the createdDate for request, triage, patient, attendance and even for drug type deps""

