<li>Check the Symphony DAD outbound service used for WCP: enabled, correct TPWAL endpoint, no obvious errors. [\[RLSE001210...Viewer CRN | PDF\]](<a href=""https://uhgazure.sharepoint.com/sites/EMIS_SDM/Delivery%20Documents/Release%20Documentation/Symphony/TPWAL/v1.0.10.2/RLSE0012104%20-TPWAL%20v1.0.10.2%20-%20RBAC%20changes%20for%20Web%20Viewer%20CRN.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">https://uhgazure.sharepoint.com/sites/EMIS_SDM/Delivery%20Documents/Release%20Documentation/Symphony/TPWAL/v1.0.10.2/RLSE0012104%20-TPWAL%20v1.0.10.2%20-%20RBAC%20changes%20for%20Web%20Viewer%20CRN.pdf</a>), [\[RLSE001124...ease Notes | PDF\]](<a href=""https://uhgazure.sharepoint.com/sites/EMIS_SDM/Delivery%20Documents/Release%20Documentation/Symphony/TPWAL/v1.0.9.1/RLSE0011242%20-TPWAL%20v1.0.9.1%20-%20Docman%20error%20handling%20Customer%20Release%20Notes.pdf"" target=""_blank"" rel=""noopener noreferrer"">https://uhgazure.sharepoint.com/sites/EMIS_SDM/Delivery%20Documents/Release%20Documentation/Symphony/TPWAL/v1.0.9.1/RLSE0011242%20-TPWAL%20v1.0.9.1%20-%20Docman%20error%20handling%20Customer%20Release%20Notes.pdf</a>)</li>
