Issue:

A customer reported that an advanced filter 'UTC' is disappearing in ST Richards ED, while the same filter functions correctly in Worthing ED, causing monitoring issues. The customer requested an audit to identify who is removing the filter.

Key Actions Taken:

Acknowledged the case and assigned reference number CS1745113
Investigated the issue and identified a potential link to a software bug in the system
Raised a Problem Record (PRB) under reference PRB0052368 for further technical investigation
Provided a workaround to recreate the filter when it disappears
Shared SQL queries to audit filter activity, including joins with staff tables to identify creation and update details
Noted that the issue may not be user-specific and required development work to resolve


