08/04/2026 11:28:24 - Sheree Chadwick (Work notes)
Looks like the reinitialization has turned this function off as is off on LIVE.  Found change tracking is a new feature in sql 2025  that apparently Leeds set up themselves. It has a 6 day retention.

Change tracking has to be switched on on the actual database for it to be enabled on the tables.  

ALTER DATABASE YourDatabase SET CHANGE_TRACKING = ON (CHANGE_RETENTION = 2 (default) DAYS, AUTO_CLEANUP = ON)

Once this has been done have to turn each table on as required 

alter table 
enable change_tracking
with (track_columns_updated = on)
 
All tables required now have traking turned on

