The report selection criteria is:
{Attendance_Details.atd_arrivaldate} >= {@dDateRegFrom}
and {Attendance_Details.atd_arrivaldate} <= {@dDateRegTo}
and {Attendance_Details.atd_attendancetype} <> 1

and {Attendance_Details.atd_num} like [""sgc*"", ""wgh*"", ""lgi*"", ""SJ*""]

and ({@nAge} in 16 to 17)
and {Attendance_Details.atd_deleted}<> true

And
if {@ldeptid}<>0 then 
{Episodes.epd_deptid}={@ldeptid} else 
{Episodes.epd_deptid}={Episodes.epd_deptid}


