Daily job has been successful. No issues with output of the extract file from Symphony.
This seems to be something Leeds data team are attempting.

[EMIS_SYM_LEEDS_ECDS] .[dbo].[sy_ECDS_runExtract] 
is an outdated procedure.

dbo.sy_ECDS_runExtract_v3
Is the top level procedure now used by the daily job as follows:

-----------------------------

USE EMIS_SYM_Leeds_ECDS;
GO

set dateformat dmy
go
declare @d_startdate datetime, @v_startdate varchar(10), @d_enddate datetime, @v_enddate varchar(10), @d_today datetime, @i_datepart int
set @d_today = GETDATE()

set @v_enddate = convert(varchar(10), DATEADD(day, -1, @d_today), 103)
set @v_startdate = convert(varchar(10), DATEADD(day, -10, @v_enddate), 103)

Print 'Start date: ' + @v_startdate 
Print 'End date: ' + @v_enddate

EXEC dbo.sy_ECDS_runExtract_v3 @startdate = @v_startdate
	, @enddate = @v_enddate
	, @i_news2 = 1
	, @i_frailty = 1;
GO

-----------------------------

Need to speak to the source person attempting this.

