Alright, it took a bit to parse the description, but this is what I think is the issue being raised here:

This is on the test server, and our standard backup job has been enabled. This has interfered with the third-party backup tool that the trust use. The question is how/by whom that job was enabled, and how to make sure it doesn't happen again.

It looks like the job started early on 27/4. It doesn't look like anyone here logged on to Sth Tees at a time that could match that (or at least nobody recorded it in the Intranet).

