[code]

<h2>Finish Button Greys Out When Completing DEP – CS1779275</h2>

<h3>Table of Contents</h3>
<ul>
<li>#scenarioScenario</a></li>
<li>#prerequisitesPrerequisites</a></li>
<li>#configurationConfiguration / Setup</a></li>
<li>#behaviourFailover or Operational Behaviour</a></li>
<li>#actionsActions Taken</a></li>
<li>#notesNotes or Limitations</a></li>
<li>#examplesCustomer / Environment Examples</a></li>
<li>#keywordsKeywords</a></li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""scenario"">Scenario</h3>
<p>Users (clinical and reception staff) intermittently experience the <strong>Finish button greying out</strong> when completing DEPs such as Chief Complaint, ED Discharge, and TTO. This prevents saving and closing the DEP.</p>
<ul>
<li>Users must exit and re-enter the DEP and retype all information</li>
<li>This causes delays to care and treatment</li>
<li>No patient harm has been reported</li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""prerequisites"">Prerequisites</h3>
<ul>
<li>Access to Symphony with relevant DEP forms configured</li>
<li>User permissions to complete DEPs</li>
<li>Availability of screenshots or attendance examples where possible</li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""configuration"">Configuration / Setup</h3>
<p>No configuration issues have been identified.</p>
<ul>
<li>DEP configurations reviewed, including Chief Complaint DEP</li>
<li>Conditional logic and configuration rules analysed</li>
<li>No conditionality or obvious setup issues found</li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""behaviour"">Failover or Operational Behaviour</h3>
<ul>
<li>The Finish button appears active during form completion</li>
<li>Once the final field is completed, the button becomes disabled</li>
<li>The issue is intermittent and cannot be reproduced on demand</li>
<li>Workaround: Exit the DEP and re-enter the data to complete the record</li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""actions"">Actions Taken</h3>
<ol>
<li>Performed initial investigation of DEP configuration and conditional logic</li>
<li>Attempted to reproduce the issue in the system with no success</li>
<li>Checked Symphony error logs for affected users and times; no errors found</li>
<li>Requested screenshots and specific attendance examples from the customer</li>
<li>Reviewed evidence confirming the issue visually but without identifying a cause</li>
<li>Tested hypothesis of a validation or data condition issue; not proven</li>
<li>Requested additional reproducible examples and detailed screenshots</li>
<li>Advised workaround to exit and re-enter DEP</li>
<li>Reviewed internally and validated no further findings</li>
<li>Escalated to Problem Analyst team for further investigation</li>
</ol>

<h3 id=""notes"">Notes or Limitations</h3>
<ul>
<li>Root cause remains unknown</li>
<li>No errors recorded in logs</li>
<li>No consistent reproduction steps identified</li>
<li>Likely causes include:</li>
<ul>
<li>Hidden validation condition</li>
<li>Timing or UI state issue</li>
<li>Client-side behaviour</li>
</ul>
</ul>

<h3 id=""examples"">Customer / Environment Examples</h3>
<ul>
<li>Attendance examples provided: D0816002, D0648558</li>
<li>Screenshots supplied confirming Finish button becomes disabled</li>
<li>Issue impacts both clinical and reception users</li>
</ul>

<h3 id=""keywords"">Keywords</h3>
<p>Symphony, DEP, Finish button greyed out, CS1779275, intermittent issue, UI bug, validation issue, client side behaviour, cannot save DEP, workaround exit re-enter</p>
[/code]



